@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #EAF2F9
  BorderColor #2D70B2
  ArrowColor #35536E
}

[*] --> OUTSIDE
OUTSIDE --> CANDIDATE : ENTER / создать visitId
CANDIDATE --> CONFIRMED : inside && dwell >= 60 с
CANDIDATE --> OUTSIDE : EXIT до подтверждения / ENDED
CONFIRMED --> EXIT_PENDING : EXIT / начать grace 60 с
EXIT_PENDING --> CONFIRMED : ENTER до grace / тот же visitId
EXIT_PENDING --> OUTSIDE : grace истёк / ENDED
CONFIRMED --> CONFIRMED : повторная оценка / без дубля

note right of EXIT_PENDING
  Техническое состояние Presence Engine;
  в БД визит ещё CONFIRMED.
end note
@enduml
